    "sections": {
        "description": "Photo Nook is a modern WordPress block theme built for wedding photographers and photography studios. Designed for wedding photography portfolios, engagement and elopement photography, as well as portrait, family, and lifestyle photographers, it gives you a fast, professional website without the hassle of a separate page builder. Clean typography, soft color palettes, and image-first layouts keep the focus on your photography rather than the interface. Because everything is built with native WordPress blocks, editing pages, adding sections, or rearranging your homepage takes minutes in the Site Editor — no shortcodes, bloated plugin stack, or separate builder to learn. Built-in photography portfolio layouts showcase your galleries, while dedicated pricing package sections and client testimonial areas help turn browsing visitors into booked clients. Whether you’re a wedding photographer showcasing full wedding galleries, an elopement photographer sharing intimate celebrations, or a portrait photographer building a studio website, Photo Nook provides layouts designed around photography rather than a generic business template."
    },
